              "type": "qa",
              "q": "You rebased a pushed `feature`. Now `git push` is rejected. Why, and what is the fix?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "Rebase made new SHAs, so local and remote diverged.",
                "Use `git push --force-with-lease`, never plain `--force`.",
                "Only safe if nobody else builds on the branch."
              ]
            },
